- [1mNot one message:[0m I sent both in one message twice, and the atlas dispatch hook denied both times. On the second try bandA launched, but bandB was denied      
  again, so I resent bandB on its own.                                                                                                                     
- [1mPrompt changes the hook required:[0m                                                                                                                             
  - I split the labels onto separate lines.                                                                                                                   
  - I widened the TOOLS line to name serena (activate_project, get_symbols_overview, find_symbol) and context-mode alongside lean-ctx.                     
  - bandB's REPORT line now starts with the standard field list, followed by your STATUS: DONE plus line counts. bandA kept your REPORT line as written and got
    through on a one-time warning, so the next dispatch without the field list will be denied.
- [1mNames and background flag:[0m the Agent tool has no [94mname[39m or [94mrun_in_background[39m parameter. bandA and bandB are set as the agents' descriptions, and subagents run  
  in the background by default.                                                                                                                                 
